      "card_ids": ["C09"],
      "claim": "In a steady-state tissue distribution study in mice, Vistusertib showed limited BBB penetration with brain distribution less than 5% of plasma concentration.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C02"],
      "claim": "In healthy human males, [11C]AcL703 showed very low regional brain uptake on PET, indicating poor BBB penetration.",
